it a bit easier to search and scan the gismu list. Anyone who wishes  
may try it. The documentation, such as it is, is:

http://www.tassos-oak.com/tempp/gismu_read_me.pdf

and the program itself is

http://www.tassos-oak.com/tempp/gismu.tcl

